"Most commands are grouped (`pygeofetch search run`, `pygeofetch index "
"ndvi`). A few are single commands (`pygeofetch doctor`, `pygeofetch "
"status`). `--help` works at every level:"
msgstr ""
"La plupart des commandes sont groupées (`pygeofetch search run`, `pygeofetch"
" index ndvi`). Quelques-unes sont des commandes isolées (`pygeofetch "
"doctor`, `pygeofetch status`). `--help` fonctionne à tous les niveaux :"

